From e51dcdb84d9555c89c8116a70d9312b6c96b5646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Janek210102j <janek210102j@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:16:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Socials and press kit pages, two Spotify players, shows
 toggle

- Footer: year updates itself, booking line with email; plain email
  (with copy button) on the Contact page
- Shows: Upcoming / Past toggle; opens on past shows when nothing is planned
- Releases: two Spotify players (latest release + current album), both set
  in admin; link parser now accepts /intl-xx/ links and Spotify URIs
- Link previews: 1200x630 share image of the burning still life and a real
  description in index.html
- About Us: both headings, texts, band members and photo order editable
- Socials: new page with platform cards + admin editor (add, edit,
  reorder, remove, card images); same links drive the footer icons
- Press kit (EPK) at /#/press: genre line, manifesto, lineup photo, press
  quotes, video, booking email and tech rider PDF, all editable in admin
- storage.rules: real admin UID, PDF uploads for the press kit, deletes
  allowed (they were blocked by the contentType check)
- Admin editors refuse to save if the current content failed to load, so
  defaults can't overwrite real content
- Tests for the new helpers and page views

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0115yEir6TJxrDkkp9hfACwd
